'''Hive''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade and guard are beige in color with a hexagon pattern imprinted on the blade, resembling the look of a bee’s hive, hence the name. The handle is solid black.

==Trivia ==
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [http://www.roblox.com/Hive-item?id=315501434 here].

